# Copy to deploy/compose/.env (git-ignored) and fill it in. Never commit the real file.
#
# Production LLM (ADR-0011): a key from the Console workspace "turnward",
# which has its own monthly spend limit. On AWS the same key lives in an
# SSM SecureString and reaches only the worker task.
#
# Never export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in a shared or global shell environment:
# other tools on the machine (Claude Code among them) would pick it up.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
